  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Early Warning System and Natural Risk Management</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Sistema de Alerta Temprana y Gestin de Riesgo Natural</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reduce the vulnerability of zones affected by current and potential volcanic activity of the Cotopaxi and Tungurahua. This will be achieved through the implementation of an early warning system and the modernization of the institutional framework for risk management under the premise that prevention is a development issue that needs to be considered since the planning stage</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
